# ============================================================
# WASL AI — the build context of the image
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# ⛔ The local secrets must NEVER enter the build context: the image
#   is built from this directory and every file of the context is sent
#   to the daemon.
# ⛔ `.local/` holds the database credentials and the backup key.
# ============================================================
.local/
node_modules/
.git/
.gitignore
*.log
docs/previews/
coverage/
